  "description": "Prebuilt native libraries (hcvault-core) used by HCVault.Core: a portable\n      subset of the VeraCrypt volume core (create / open / sector I/O / header\n      re-encryption for normal and hidden volumes, plus exFAT via the bundled\n      FatFs) behind a stable C API (vcapi.h).\n\n      Ships runtimes/{rid}/native binaries for Windows (x64/x86/ARM64), Linux\n      (x64) and Android (arm64-v8a/armeabi-v7a/x86/x86_64). Build from the\n      repository sources with CMake if you need another platform.",
